<title>PHILIPPINES: FPHC to issue $300 mln notes before August.</title>
<headline>FPHC to issue $300 mln notes before August.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Philippine Holdings Corp (FPHC) said on Friday it planned $300 million worth of Euroconvertible notes should be before August.</p>
<p>FPHC president Elpidio Ibanez said shareholders at a meeting on Friday agreed to the issuance of a corporate guarantee for the notes to be issued which required an amendment to the company's articles of incorporation.</p>
<p>Ibanez said that proceeds of the issue will be used for the company's industrial park, power and toll road projects.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
